  "details": "On desktop, when grabbing the MEGABLASTER XTREME 10000 from a distance, the item snaps to hand so that it is held by its gun grip.\n\nOn VR, when grabbing the MEGABLASTER XTREME 10000 from a distance (or anywhere other than the far edge of the gun grip), the item snaps to hand so that the center pivot of the item is held.\n\nThis makes it extremely awkward to hold properly in VR, especially since the intended functionality is to enable the player to hold it by the grip in one hand, and by the pumping mechanism with their other hand. Please fix this.",
